      voice: 'gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy #ctx:1iahcrz'
    '|a||It falls: their debt now costs more, which makes them poorer, and later has become cheaper too, so both effects push down.':
